 {"type":"fill","q":"若 \\(|A|=4\\)，则 \\(|P(A)|=\\) ____","answer":["16","2^4"],"why":"n 元集的幂集有 \\(2^n\\) 个元素，\\(2^4=16\\)。"},
 {"type":"fill","q":"\\(A=\\{1,2,3\\}\\)，\\(P(A)\\) 中恰含 2 个元素的子集有 ____ 个。","answer":["3","三"],"why":"按大小计数 1+3+3+1=8，其中二元子集为 {1,2},{1,3},{2,3}，共 3 个。"},
 {"type":"choice","q":"\\(B\\not\\subseteq A\\) 等价于下列哪个式子？","options":["\\(\\forall x(x\\in B\\to x\\notin A)\\)","\\(\\exists x(x\\in B\\land x\\notin A)\\)","\\(\\exists x(x\\in B\\to x\\notin A)\\)","\\(\\forall x(x\\notin B\\lor x\\in A)\\)"],"answer":1,"why":"对 \\(\\forall x(x\\in B\\to x\\in A)\\) 取否定：\\(\\exists x\\neg(x\\notin B\\lor x\\in A)\\Leftrightarrow\\exists x(x\\in B\\land x\\notin A)\\)。D 恰是 \\(B\\subseteq A\\)。"},
 {"type":"choice","q":"\\(\\mathcal{A}=\\{\\{1,2,3\\},\\{2,3,4\\},\\{2,3,5\\}\\}\\)，则 \\(\\bigcap\\mathcal{A}\\) 与 \\(\\bigcup\\mathcal{A}\\) 分别为？","options":["\\(\\{2,3\\}\\)，\\(\\{1,2,3,4,5\\}\\)","\\(\\{2,3\\}\\)，\\(\\{1,2,3,4,5,6\\}\\)","\\(\\emptyset\\)，\\(\\{1,2,3,4,5\\}\\)","\\(\\{1,4,5\\}\\)，\\(\\{2,3\\}\\)"],"answer":0,"why":"三个成员共同的元素为 2、3；所有成员元素合在一起为 1,2,3,4,5。"},
 {"type":"choice","q":"关于空集族 \\(\\emptyset\\) 与集族 \\(\\{\\emptyset\\}\\)，下列说法正确的是？","options":["\\(\\bigcap\\{\\emptyset\\}\\) 无意义","\\(\\bigcup\\emptyset=\\emptyset\\)，且 \\(\\bigcap\\{\\emptyset\\}=\\emptyset\\)","\\(\\bigcup\\{\\emptyset\\}=\\{\\emptyset\\}\\)","\\(\\bigcap\\emptyset=\\emptyset\\)"],"answer":1,"why":"\\(\\bigcup\\emptyset\\) 中 \\(z\\in\\emptyset\\) 恒假，结果为空；\\(\\{\\emptyset\\}\\) 唯一成员是 \\(\\emptyset\\)，其交即 \\(\\emptyset\\)。\\(\\bigcap\\emptyset\\) 条件恒真，未限定全集时无意义，限定全集时为 E，而不是 \\(\\emptyset\\)。"},
 {"type":"fill","q":"\\(A=\\{1,2,3,4\\}\\)，\\(B=\\{3,4,5\\}\\)，则 \\(A\\oplus B=\\) ____（用列举法）","answer":["{1,2,5}","\\{1,2,5\\}"],"why":"\\(A\\oplus B=(A\\cup B)-(A\\cap B)=\\{1,2,3,4,5\\}-\\{3,4\\}=\\{1,2,5\\}\\)。"},
 {"type":"fill","q":"有限集满足 \\(|A|=10,|B|=8,|C|=6,|A\\cap B|=3,|A\\cap C|=2,|B\\cap C|=4,|A\\cap B\\cap C|=1\\)，则 \\(|A\\cup B\\cup C|=\\) ____","answer":["16"],"why":"容斥定理：10+8+6−(3+2+4)+1=16。"},
 {"type":"fill","q":"1 到 100 的整数中，能被 2 或 3 整除的有 ____ 个。","answer":["67"],"why":"\\(|A|=50,|B|=33,|A\\cap B|=\\lfloor100/6\\rfloor=16\\)，\\(|A\\cup B|=50+33-16=67\\)。"}
